      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to introduce this fantastic 2 bed 1 bath OWN DOOR ACCESS apartment to the market in the popular development of Millpark, Dublin 22. Ideally positioned in the heart of Clondalkin Village, the location is truly next to none. Literally on your doorstep you will find a selection of amenities including The Mill Shopping Centre, Clondalkin Leisure Centre, The Round Tower, both primary & secondary schools, and a choice of bars & restaurants. Bus routes are within arm's reach and The Luas & M50 motorway are accessible within minutes by car.\nLiving accommodation of c. 65 Sq m comprises of entrance stairway, two double bedrooms, the main family bathroom and a kitchen/ dining area with an additional living space boasting a fabulous dual aspect with x 2 balconies. The property also features an additional large attic space with stira for excellent use of storage. Externally you will find communal gardens and secure gated parking.\nNo. 156 is presented in great condition throughout and boasts a long list of additional features to include dual aspect balconies, gated complex, gated parking, LARGE attic space, fitted wardrobes to both bedrooms and comes to the market with a B BER rating qualifying for a green mortgage. Due to recent success specifically in this development, we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers at your earliest convenience to register your interest.\n\nFeatures:\n• BER B qualifying of a green mortgage\n• Two double bedrooms\n• Dual aspect with two balconies\n• Spacious attic for additional storage, a unique benefit rarely found in apartments.\n• Secure gated complex\n• Gas Fired Central Heating\n• Highly desirable development\n• c. 65 Sq m\n• MGT Fees c. 1,400 P/ A\n• Designated parking\n• Gated underground parking\n• Seconds to Clondalkin Village\n• The Mill Shopping Centre neighbouring\n• Serviced by local bus routes\n• Fantastic opportunity\n• Enquire today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections:\nHeading through Clondalkin Village along Tower road, just after the round tower take a left turn onto Old Nangor Road and continue until your 2nd right hand turn into the Millpark Development. No. 156 will be on your right hand side overlooking the green with own door access."
      },
      {
